      "section_path": "Part I Item 2 > CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 2",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "CAPITAL RESOURCES",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "We believe that existing Cash and equivalents, Short-term investments and cash provided by operations, together with access to external sources of funds as described above, will be sufficient to meet our domestic and foreign capital needs for the next twelve months and beyond.",
      "char_start": 42551,
      "char_end": 42828,
      "raw_spans": [
